     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Since when and until when",
     "texto": [
      "**Od** with a time expression marks the starting point of a situation that continues to now: **od dwóch lat** («for two years»).",
      "The perfective aspect can present the change as a completed event: **przeprowadziliśmy się** («we moved»)."
     ],
